ducational success of those participating in varsity programs. It remains a foundational institution in American culture, bridging the gap between higher education and highly competitive, televised amateur sports.", "external": {"instagram": {"id": "ncaa"}, "twitter": {"id": "NCAA"}, "wikidata": {"id": "Q271805"}}, "founded_year": "1906", "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/6455127D-C7CE-40D8-AA9B-807567A56C86-420x-auto.jpg"}, "short_description": "The NCAA is a nonprofit organization that regulates and organizes college athletics among about 1,100 U.S. schools, hosting championships and promoting student-athlete well-being.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "de", "value": "Die führende Organisation für US-Hochschulsport, die Meisterschaftsturniere überwacht und akademische sowie sportliche Standards für studentische Athleten festlegt."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Organización rectora del deporte universitario estadounidense que supervisa torneos y establece estándares académicos y de rendimiento para los estudiantes-atletas."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "L'organisation régissant le sport universitaire aux États-Unis, supervisant les tournois de championnat et les normes académiques pour les étudiants-athlètes."}, {"language": "en", "value": "The governing organization for United States collegiate athletics overseeing championship tournaments and establishing academic and performance standards for student-athletes."}]}, "popularity": 0.9873963824990253, "disambiguation": "", "tags": [{"name": "Sports NGO", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre:brand:ngo:sports", "type": "urn:tag:genre:brand"}, {"name": "Sports Organization", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre:brand:sports_organization", "type": "urn:tag:genre:brand"}, {"name": "NGO", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre:brand:ngo", "type": "urn:tag:genre:brand"}, {"name": "Leagues & Tournaments", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre:brand:sports_organization:league_tournament", "type": "urn:tag:genre:brand"}, {"name": "Formal Branding", "tag_id"